    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say there was a fisherman, burdened by memories too heavy to carry, who sailed into waters where no man had ever dared to go. Some would tell you he sought redemption, others would say it was peace he was after. But the sea gives neither.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/01a0dc04fad7dc2c19c5cc552e1fa225.poster.avif?t=1750194898\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/01a0dc04fad7dc2c19c5cc552e1fa225.webm?t=1750194898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/01a0dc04fad7dc2c19c5cc552e1fa225.mp4?t=1750194898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the Horrors of the Sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days turned into nights, and the nights into days, the fisherman sailed farther, farther than any man should. His boat became a part of him, and the waters around him grew dark and deep, as though the sea itself had swallowed his mind. Soon, no one could tell where the sea ended and his madness began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whispers still call to those brave enough to listen, and the tide never forgets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Fishing Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An increasingly more challenging mechanic that rewards your skill and evolves as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fish behaves differently and requires you to adapt your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/8945bbb3a803a5694d1cb9aed7839f81.poster.avif?t=1750194898\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/8945bbb3a803a5694d1cb9aed7839f81.webm?t=1750194898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/8945bbb3a803a5694d1cb9aed7839f81.mp4?t=1750194898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Fish Like the Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover horrifying creatures with each catch you pull out of the sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/b13663ea57771f282cc159eb771bf50c.poster.avif?t=1750194898\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/b13663ea57771f282cc159eb771bf50c.webm?t=1750194898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799050/extras/b13663ea57771f282cc159eb771bf50c.mp4?t=1750194898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere &amp; PSX-style Graphics</strong> - Immerse yourself in a hauntingly nostalgic world with PSX-inspired visuals that enhance the eerie atmosphere of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Mechanics</strong> - Cast your line into the dark waters, where the sea tests your coordination while pulling you deeper into madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark, Gripping Linear Story</strong> - Unravel a tragic tale of guilt, loss, and redemption, where the past is never far behind and the sea holds secrets that may never let you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Entirely New Experience of Mourning Tide</strong> - Featuring 1 hour of gameplay.</p></li></ul>",
